Excuse me.

00:31:13.650 --> 00:31:14.550
I see a portal potty.

00:31:15.970 --> 00:31:16.390
Never mind.

00:31:17.520 --> 00:31:18.040
I have to work.

00:31:18.820 --> 00:31:19.420
Open my eyes.

00:31:25.280 --> 00:31:26.440
Dude, use the bushes.

00:31:26.740 --> 00:31:27.080
Bushes.

