Hey, I'm Mr. Bush.

00:31:34.840 --> 00:31:35.950
So nice and green.

00:31:37.110 --> 00:31:38.210
I am your sprinkler.

00:31:40.750 --> 00:31:41.190
Sprinkler.

00:31:41.480 --> 00:31:42.000
It's funny.

00:31:43.040 --> 00:31:43.600
More people, sir.

00:31:49.400 --> 00:31:50.380
Coming, coming, coming.

