My son is safely tucked into his bed.

00:32:00.000 --> 00:32:02.020
upstairs. He's not Ephraim Brown.

00:32:02.420 --> 00:32:02.960
Depends.

00:32:03.700 --> 00:32:04.280
What did he do?

00:32:04.480 --> 00:32:06.800
Public intoxication and underage drinking.

00:32:07.160 --> 00:32:09.040
He's never been a problem before, so we didn't take him in.

00:32:09.460 --> 00:32:10.380
But if we catch him again...

00:32:10.380 --> 00:32:11.740
If you catch him again, you better keep him.

00:32:13.050 --> 00:32:13.690
Thank you, officer.

00:32:22.260 --> 00:32:23.060
You've got to be kidding me.

